spec:
  id: error_patterns
  version: 1.0.0
  status: stable
  priority: highest
  module: Cognition
  compiler_stage: Error Recognition
  description: >
purpose[6]: Detect,classify,explain,predict,prevent,engineering mistakes.
philosophy[6]: Errors repeat.,Mistakes have patterns.,Prevention is superior,to correction.,Every error teaches,reusable engineering knowledge.
pipeline[11]: Observation,→,Pattern Recognition,→,Classification,→,Root Cause,→,Prevention,→,Learning
categories[13]: Cognitive,Logical,Algorithmic,Implementation,Concurrency,Memory,Performance,Security,Architecture,Infrastructure,Configuration,Process,Organizational
cognitive[6]: Confirmation Bias,Tunnel Vision,Overconfidence,Premature Optimization,Incorrect Assumptions,False Analogy
logical[5]: Off By One,Infinite Loop,Incorrect Condition,Null Handling,State Violation
algorithmic[5]: Wrong Complexity,Invalid Data Structure,Overflow,Underflow,Infinite Recursion
implementation[6]: Resource Leak,Duplicate Logic,Hidden Coupling,Tight Coupling,Dead Code,Magic Numbers
concurrency[5]: Race Condition,Deadlock,Starvation,Livelock,Atomicity Violation
memory[4]: Store Pattern,Reinforce Pattern,Link Similar Errors,Retrieve Previous Cases
performance[5]: N Plus One Query,Excessive Allocation,Cache Thrashing,Lock Contention,Busy Waiting
security[6]: SQL Injection,Command Injection,Buffer Overflow,Weak Authentication,Missing Authorization,Secret Exposure
architecture[5]: God Object,Circular Dependency,Shared Database,Chatty Services,Premature Microservices
infrastructure[4]: Single Point Of Failure,Missing Backup,Misconfigured Network,Resource Exhaustion
process[4]: Missing Tests,Missing Documentation,Manual Deployment,Poor Monitoring
attributes[7]: identity,category,frequency,severity,detectability,reproducibility,impact
causes[6]: Knowledge Gap,Wrong Mental Model,Incorrect Assumption,Missing Validation,Human Error,External Dependency
detection[7]: Static Analysis,Dynamic Analysis,Testing,Benchmark,Monitoring,Code Review,Production Metrics
prevention[6]: Better Design,Better Tests,Static Analysis,Documentation,Automation,Education
recovery[5]: Patch,Refactor,Rollback,Redesign,Hotfix
reasoning[4]: Pattern Matching,Analogical Reasoning,Root Cause Analysis,Counterfactual Reasoning
ekr:
  description: Every Engineering Knowledge Record
  records[5]: Error Pattern,Root Cause,Detection,Prevention,Lessons Learned
validation[8]: Every error pattern,has evidence.,Every error,has prevention.,Every error,has recovery.,Every pattern,improves future reasoning.
examples:
  Example_01:
    Pattern: N Plus One Query
    Detection: SQL Profiler
    Prevention: Batch Loading
  Example_02:
    Pattern: Race Condition
    Detection: Thread Sanitizer
    Prevention: Proper Synchronization
  Example_03:
    Pattern: Premature Optimization
    Detection: Benchmark Analysis
    Prevention: Measure First
  Example_04:
    Pattern: God Object
    Detection: High Coupling Metrics
    Prevention: Component Decomposition
metrics[6]: Error Frequency,Detection Accuracy,Prevention Rate,Mean Time To Detect,Mean Time To Recover,Repeat Error Rate
success[6]: Engineering systems,recognize recurring,"mistakes early,","prevent repetition,",and continuously,improve engineering quality.
guarantees[5]: Explicit Error Knowledge,Root Cause Traceability,Preventive Engineering,Reusable Lessons,Continuous Quality Improvement
future:
  autonomous_pattern_discovery: true
  predictive_error_detection: true
  graph_based_error_propagation: true
  self_correcting_reasoning: true
  organization_specific_patterns: true
